SUMMARY:Greetings from Davis: Write a Postcard Home
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261001T130000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261001T143000
UID:tag:localist.com\,2008:EventInstance_53683260007656
DESCRIPTION:You’ve moooved into your apartment or res hall\, and classes
  have started. Let your friends and family back home know how you're doing
  the old-fashioned way — with a postcard! Drop by Shields Library and ou
 r Archives and Special Collections Department will provide everything you 
 need: a pen\, UC Davis Library postcard\, and postage.
LOCATION:Shields Library\, Lobby
