 ure your maps are accessible. Also\, learn about new UC Davis Health map w
 ith 3D printing\, and UC Davis Campus map & Spatial Audio Wayfinding map! 
 Come with questions on how to ensure that your maps work well for a variet
 y of audiences.\n\n \n\nSpeaker: Josh Hori\n\n \n\nJoshua Hori is the Acce
 ssible Technology Coordinator at UC Davis\, working within Information Edu
 cation Technology and Academic Technology Services. Working with Disabilit
 y Management Services to provide assistive technologies to staff and facul
 ty\, after 15+ years providing technology to students in the Student Disab
 ility Center.\n\n \n\nPrerequisites: None\n\n \n\nSoftware Required: None
